# Raw and generated media, none of it part of a deploy:
#   assets/supplier/  supplier .docx sheets + photos (input to tools/catalogue-ingest)
#   assets/telegram/  unprocessed HEIC/MOV straight off a phone
#   assets/creatives/ ad creatives in progress
/assets

# Video masters. The hero's source is a 23 MB 4K file; only the renditions built
# from it (apps/web/public/video/hero-*) are served, and they are three orders of
# magnitude smaller. Keep masters in assets/media/ (ignored above) so a deploy never carries one — anything
# under public/ is fetchable by a visitor, and a stray 23 MB in a hero is the
# exact problem the renditions exist to solve. See apps/web/components/HeroVideo.tsx for
# the ffmpeg commands that regenerate them.

# Local scratch
llm_context.txt
.thumbnail
coverage/

